lines=[f'# Regex-redux profiling and source-size audit: {rid}','',f'Measured clean source: `{summary["measured_revision"]}` after integrating dev `{summary["upstream_revision"]}` and rebuilding. Baseline program source: `{summary["baseline_source_revision"]}`. Both sides of final paired comparisons use the same integrated compiler/runtime and -O2/-DNDEBUG program flags. Foreign sources and calibration `53fdc5b1230c52ce` remain pinned; foreign timings were not repeated.','', '## Result','', 'Tuned regex-redux now uses one native PCRE2 JIT match stream per literal substitution and alternates two typed scratch buffers through the five ordered replacements. It also strips headers/newlines into typed storage, caches native handles outside match loops, and avoids sizing scans and canonical intermediate Strings. Each count worker retains private native match state and reads the fixed caller-owned sequence through joins. Only the six prescribed consuming patterns use the specialized helper; other negative native results raise rather than silently producing partial replacements. The general package API is unchanged.','', '| FASTA input units | Before ms | After ms | After / before | Paired wins |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
